cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "scgraph: Graph Engineering for Software Supply-Chain Impact Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A fully local, zero-LLM-to-build pipeline over the open-source dependency graph that
  answers whether a project is exposed to a given vulnerability, through which dependency
  path, and what the safe fix is, and that abstains when it cannot justify an alert with
  a resolvable path. Built and validated end to end on 4.46 million packages, 21.4
  million versions, and 82.8 million resolved dependency edges across eight ecosystems.
type: software
